                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.21.0"&gt;3.21.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Add support for NLog 6.x.x&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Improve the CodeOwners parser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Data stream Monitoring] Various fixes for Kinesis, SQS, SNS, and RabbitMQ integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Serverless] Add preview support for &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/Datadog.AzureFunctions/3.21.0-preview#readme-body-tab" rel="nofollow"&gt;Datadog.AzureFunctions&lt;/a&gt; NuGet package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for NLog 6.0 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3168703495" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7131" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7131/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7131"&gt;#7131&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show correct &lt;code&gt;agent_uri&lt;/code&gt; path in startup log for named pipes (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3218685849" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7199" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7199/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7199"&gt;#7199&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Try removing exceptions from the shutdown path (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3219277942" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7200" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7200/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7200"&gt;#7200&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use non-BOM version of &lt;code&gt;Encoding.UTF8&lt;/code&gt; in Libdatadog interop code (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3220046003" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7204" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7204/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7204"&gt;#7204&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat(libdatadog-logger): integrate libdatadog logging (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3124491773" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7075" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7075/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7075"&gt;#7075&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
